      "writtenOn": "2023-01-27T03:34:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "On a second thougth, it is better to keep an operation naming that is more descriptive to user, `lock` and `unlock` have an implicit message to be handled with care.\nOn a further matter, I am evaluating if I should move the mutex from the state machine into the driver level.",
